§ `Article 26(7): before putting into service or using a system at the workplace, an employer informs the workers' representatives and the affected workers`

-- "Before putting into service or using": the deadline is the date on which the deployer puts into service or uses the system at the workplace, inclusive (fork F-prior-to in NOTES.md).
-- The second sentence, "where applicable, in accordance with the rules and procedures laid down in Union and national law and practice on information of workers and their representatives", is owed only where such rules exist.
-- src:501 | 7. Before putting into service or using a high-risk AI system at the workplace, deployers who are employers shall inform workers’ representatives and the affected workers that they will be subject to the use of the high-risk AI system. This information shall be provided, where applicable, in accordance with the rules and procedures laid down in Union and national law and practice on information of workers and their representatives.
@ref Art 26(7) (src:501)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the deployer is an employer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system is to be put into service or used at the workplace` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the deployer has informed the workers' representatives and the affected workers that they will be subject to the use of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there are rules and procedures laid down in Union and national law and practice on information of workers and their representatives` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is provided in accordance with those rules and procedures` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 26(7) the deployer that is an employer has informed the workers' representatives and the affected workers` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT (`the deployer is an employer` AND `the high-risk AI system is to be put into service or used at the workplace`)
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Before putting into service or using a high-risk AI system at the workplace, deployers who are employers shall inform" (the deployer is not an employer, or the system is not for the workplace)
        ELSE
             IF `the deployer has informed the workers' representatives and the affected workers that they will be subject to the use of the high-risk AI system` AND ((NOT `there are rules and procedures laid down in Union and national law and practice on information of workers and their representatives`) OR `the information is provided in accordance with those rules and procedures`)
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "deployers who are employers shall inform workers' representatives and the affected workers that they will be subject to the use of the high-risk AI system"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 26, "", 0)

@ref Art 26(7) (src:501)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the deployer is an employer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the high-risk AI system is to be put into service or used at the workplace` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date on which the deployer puts the high-risk AI system into service or uses it at the workplace` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 26 act`
`Art 26(7) the deployer's duty to inform the workers' representatives and the affected workers before putting into service or using the system at the workplace` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the deployer is an employer` AND `the high-risk AI system is to be put into service or used at the workplace`
    THEN PARTY Deployer
         MUST `Art 26(7) inform the workers' representatives and the affected workers`
         WITHIN daysLeft
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Deployer BECAUSE "the workers' representatives and the affected workers were not informed before the system was put into service or used at the workplace"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, the deployer is not an employer, or the system is not for the workplace
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 26, "", 0)
        daysLeft MEANS IF (Day `the date on which the deployer puts the high-risk AI system into service or uses it at the workplace`) AT LEAST (Day `the date asked`) THEN (Day `the date on which the deployer puts the high-risk AI system into service or uses it at the workplace`) MINUS (Day `the date asked`) ELSE 0


