         MUST `Art 26(8) inform the provider or the distributor that the system has not been registered`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Deployer BECAUSE "the provider or the distributor was not informed that the system had not been registered"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, the deployer is not such a public body, or it has not found the system unregistered
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 26, "", 0)


§ `Article 26(9): using the Article 13 information for a data protection impact assessment, where applicable`

-- src:503 | 9. Where applicable, deployers of high-risk AI systems shall use the information provided under Article 13 of this Regulation to comply with their obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680.
@ref Art 26(9) (src:503)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the deployer has an obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the deployer has used the information provided under Article 13 to comply with that obligation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 26(9) the deployer has used the information provided under Article 13 to comply with its obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the deployer has an obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where applicable, deployers of high-risk AI systems shall use the information provided under Article 13 ... to comply with their obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment" (the deployer has no such obligation)
        ELSE
             IF `the deployer has used the information provided under Article 13 to comply with that obligation`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "deployers of high-risk AI systems shall use the information provided under Article 13 of this Regulation to comply with their obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 26, "", 0)

@ref Art 26(9) (src:503)
