      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the deployer has an obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 26 act`
