    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the relevant competent authorities have taken an action in relation to the high-risk AI system in order to implement this Regulation`
    THEN PARTY Deployer
         MUST `Art 26(12) cooperate with the relevant competent authorities`
         HENCE FULFILLED
